==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|changes of heart}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} A change of one's [[opinion]], [[belief]] or [[decision]].
#: {{ux|en|He quit work on Friday, but on Monday he had a '''change of heart''' and decided to come back.}}

